{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Void Resurgence",
    "steam_appid": 3669050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Resurgence thrusts players into a <strong>relentless, retro-futuristic roguelike space shooter</strong>\u00a0where survival is the sole mission. Navigate cosmic battlefields, <strong>master intense bullet-hell combat</strong>, and scavenge for every scrap of hope in a galaxy consumed by chaos. <strong>Every death serves as a lesson</strong>, and every run presents a new opportunity to defy the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/386866b124d48866ae3dcdf2d4fc8df8.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>endless replayability</strong>. No two runs are ever the same, ensuring fresh challenges and discoveries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not the end,</strong>\u00a0learn from setbacks and return stronger. Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, new ships, and powerful abilities that persist across runs, enabling deeper delves into the void with each attempt.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>unique synergies and builds</strong>\u00a0as a vast arsenal of weapons and modules is collected, allowing for adaptive strategies to survive the ever-escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/f77965f475e82ce5579c3bfbfde23513.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Resurgence, everyone has their time-window of <strong>Glory!</strong>\u00a0Compete across\u00a0<strong>240 unique global leaderboards</strong>\u00a0and etch your name among the stars as one of the galaxy's true aces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/7de65c3f4fd2a2fb4d5001a8b7017b8c.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>fast-paced, pixel-perfect space combat</strong>\u00a0against swarms of alien adversaries and <strong>colossal bosses</strong>. The action is frantic and demands constant attention.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge intricate bullet-hell patterns that demand precision and quick reflexes. The ship's <strong>compact hitbox</strong>\u00a0allows for thrilling near-miss escapes, rewarding skillful navigation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a devastating array of retro-inspired weaponry, from rapid-fire lasers to <strong>screen-clearing super bombs</strong>. Feel the impact of every shot with satisfying hit indicators and explosive visual feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/08a0932e489f3ea40ed8815e850311a8.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Resurgence, survival isn't just about one successful run\u2014it's about <strong>persistent growth and ultimate mastery</strong>\u00a0over the chaos. Become stronger with every attempt and conquer the galaxy on your own terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/7a7677feb6c93569bec547e4cdbf5d91.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock <strong>10 distinct ships</strong>, each offering a unique playstyle and strategic advantages. Find the vessel that perfectly complements your combat philosophy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of <strong>20 Core Systems</strong>, the fundamental building blocks of your playstyle. Mix and match offensive cannons, defensive shields, and unique engines to architect a loadout that is entirely your own.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover profound synergies between them to unleash <strong>16 devastating Hyper Powers</strong>\u00a0for game-changing abilities that reward experimentation and can turn the tide of the most desperate battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/18d194076637bcad20d752a55efa885f.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your build and your reflexes against <strong>formidable bosses</strong>. Each encounter is a monumental challenge, demanding mastery of the game's mechanics and a solid strategy to overcome their devastating power.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the cosmic chaos with <strong>four difficulty levels</strong>. Whether you're looking for a casual flight or a hardcore, leaderboard-chasing challenge, the Void has a setting for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/3446158f600b9c917e2bacf2409bde8f.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a visually striking world rendered with <strong>crisp pixel art and vibrant neon palettes</strong>, reminiscent of arcade classics. The aesthetic provides a unique and nostalgic backdrop for the action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to an <strong>original chiptune soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that perfectly complements the high-octane action and nostalgic atmosphere, enhancing immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>classic arcade challenge blended with modern roguelike depth</strong>, offering a fresh yet familiar thrill that appeals to both veteran and new players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/9100e93962b269123287270d17ea924e.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void is vast, but pilots do not have to face it alone. <strong>Join the growing community on Discord</strong>\u00a0to share strategies, provide feedback, and connect with fellow pilots. Player insights help shape the future of Void Resurgence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Resurgence thrusts players into a <strong>relentless, retro-futuristic roguelike space shooter</strong>\u00a0where survival is the sole mission. Navigate cosmic battlefields, <strong>master intense bullet-hell combat</strong>, and scavenge for every scrap of hope in a galaxy consumed by chaos. <strong>Every death serves as a lesson</strong>, and every run presents a new opportunity to defy the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/386866b124d48866ae3dcdf2d4fc8df8.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>endless replayability</strong>. No two runs are ever the same, ensuring fresh challenges and discoveries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not the end,</strong>\u00a0learn from setbacks and return stronger. Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, new ships, and powerful abilities that persist across runs, enabling deeper delves into the void with each attempt.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>unique synergies and builds</strong>\u00a0as a vast arsenal of weapons and modules is collected, allowing for adaptive strategies to survive the ever-escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/f77965f475e82ce5579c3bfbfde23513.avif?t=1755434583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Resurgence, everyone has their time-window of <strong>Glory!</strong>\u00a0Compete across\u00a0<stron